      "items": [
        "The famous Battle of Ten Kings (Dasrajan War) was fought on the banks of the Parushni (modern Ravi) river.",
        "The Gayatri Mantra is found in the 3rd Mandala of the Rigveda and was composed by Sage Vishvamitra.",
        "In Vedic texts, 'Ayas' referred to copper/bronze in the Early Vedic period, whereas 'Krishna Ayas' or 'Shyama Ayas' referred to iron in the Later Vedic period.",
        "Mundaka Upanishad is the source of the Indian national motto 'Satyameva Jayate'."
      ],
